OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FA former secondary school teacher from
OL,7,FLytham St Annes has been jailed for 11
OL,8,Fyears after grooming and engaging in
OL,9,Fsexual activity with a teenage student.
OL,11,FDavid Brown, 35, was sentenced at
OL,12,FPreston Crown Court after admitting
OL,13,Fone count of sexual communication with
OL,14,Fa child, three counts of sexual
OL,15,Factivity with a child, and one count
OL,16,Fof causing a child to engage in sexual
OL,17,Factivity.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
