PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FBrown, now of no fixed abode, used his
OL,7,Fposition of trust to target the girl,
OL,8,Fa pupil at his school, and exploit her
OL,9,Fover a period spanning more than a
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe abuse began in July 2024, with
OL,13,FBrown using his school email to groom
OL,14,Fthe victim, convincing her that he
OL,15,Fcared about her.
OL,17,FHe went on to communicate with the
OL,18,Fgirl over social media and video
OL,19,Fcalls, including incidents where he
OL,20,Fappeared in his underwear.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
