FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FIn December 2025, Brown kissed the
OL,7,Fteenager and then began driving her to
OL,8,Fsecluded areas, where further sexual
OL,9,Fabuse took place, sometimes at a
OL,10,Fproperty.
OL,12,FThe abuse came to light in January
OL,13,F2026 after the victim's parent
OL,14,Fcontacted police.
OL,16,FOfficers searched Brown's classroom
OL,17,Fand found four mobile phones hidden in
OL,18,Fhis desk, along with evidence of
OL,19,Faround 700 sexually explicit messages
OL,20,Fbetween Brown and the victim.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
