CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FBrown attempted to arrange meetings
OL,7,Fwhere he could be alone with the girl
OL,8,Fto commit his offences.
OL,10,FBrown was arrested and did not comment
OL,11,Fduring police interviews but later
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to the offences in
OL,13,Fcourt. He will also be placed on the
OL,14,Fsex offenders register.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
