CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FIn a Victim Impact Statement, the
OL,7,Fvictim's mother said: "This incident
OL,8,Fhas kept me awake night after night
OL,9,Ffor months, with feelings of guilt,
OL,10,Fguilt that I was not able to do what I
OL,11,Fconsider to be the most important job
OL,12,Fin the world, protecting my child.
OL,14,F"I feel that David has stolen a year
OL,15,Fof our lives, a year of childhood
OL,16,Fmemories I should be making for my
OL,17,Fdaughters have been taken away."
OL,26,@oD@WOUyD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
