CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FDetective Sergeant Adam Errington
OL,7,Fpraised the victim's courage and said:
OL,8,F"She was made to believe that Brown
OL,9,Fcared for her, that he had done
OL,10,Fnothing wrong.
OL,12,F"She was not only a victim of his
OL,13,Fsexual crimes, but also of his mental
OL,14,Fabuse. She has shown strength beyond
OL,15,Fher years in what must have been a
OL,16,Fhorrific time in her life.
OL,26,@pD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
