OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FHe continued: "I can only hope that
OL,7,Fshe now knows that justice has been
OL,8,Fserved, and that Brown has been held
OL,9,Faccountable for his actions that were
OL,10,Fso wrong."
OL,12,F"Brown is a paedophile who tried to
OL,13,Fdisguise himself as a trusted member
OL,14,Fof society. He abused his position as
OL,15,Fa teacher, as a person with a
OL,16,Fresponsibility for young people's
OL,17,Fwellbeing, all for his own sordid
OL,18,Fsexual interests."
OL,26,@rD@JO]tD@AOUzD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
