CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786366175
OL,3,CFormer teacher jailed for grooming and
OL,4,Csexually abusing teenage girl
OL,6,FDS Errington urged other young people
OL,7,Fwho may be victims of similar abuse:
OL,8,F"It isn't love, it is manipulation,
OL,9,Fand it is a crime. If you or someone
OL,10,Fyou know may be a victim of sexual
OL,11,Foffences, please tell us, or someone
OL,12,Fyou trust. We will listen to you, we
OL,13,Fwill believe you, and we will do all
OL,14,Fwe can to get you justice."
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@[O]
